OL,3,GNEWSAPsychiatric intensive care unit
OL,4,Afor women to open
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first NHS intensive care unit for
OL,7,Fwomen with serious mental health needs
OL,8,Fin Kent and Medway is due to open.
OL,10,FWomen in the region will have access to
OL,11,Fa dedicated NHS psychiatric intensive
OL,12,Fcare unit for the first time, following
OL,13,Fa #4.63m investment by Kent and Medway
OL,14,FMental Health NHS Trust.
OL,16,FThe 10-bed facility at Littlestone
OL,17,FLodge in Dartford will provide
OL,18,Fshort-term, intensive care for women
OL,19,Fexperiencing serious mental health
OL,20,Fdifficulties who need extra support.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
