OL,3,GNEWSAPsychiatric intensive care unit
OL,4,Afor women to open
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Afifa Qazi, chief medical officer
OL,7,Ffor the trust, said the opening was an
OL,8,Fimportant step forward and that until
OL,9,Fnow women needing intensive care and
OL,10,Fsupport "have not been able to receive
OL,11,Fthis specialist care from our team".
